# FINZI AI — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values before running the servers.

# ============================================================
# SERVER
# ============================================================
PORT=5000
DB_PATH=./db/finzi.db
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key-change-in-production
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d
BCRYPT_SALT_ROUNDS=12
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE=10485760

# ============================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================
# - JWT_SECRET: used to sign access tokens. Use a strong random value in production.
# - BCRYPT_SALT_ROUNDS: cost factor for password hashing (default 12).
# - DB_PATH: location of the SQLite database file.
# - UPLOAD_DIR: directory where uploaded documents are stored.
# - MAX_FILE_SIZE: max upload size in bytes (default 25 MB).
#
# OPTIONAL INTEGRATIONS (not configured — mark as pending integration):
# - GST Portal / GSTR-2B download: no real GSTN integration configured.
# - OCR / document extraction: no real OCR service configured.
# - Email/SMS notifications: no real email/SMS gateway configured.
# - AI/LLM: FINZI AI runs as a rules-based assistant on stored data; no external AI service configured.
